所蒞，惠訓融遠，述詠所寄，有賴鐫勒，非斯族也，則幾乎僭黷矣。俗敝僞興，華煩已久，是以孔悝之銘，行是人非；蔡邕制文，每有愧色。而自時厥後，其流彌多，預有臣吏，必爲建立，勒銘寡取信之實，刊石成虛僞之常，真假相蒙，殆使合美者不貴，但論其功費，又不可稱。不加禁裁，其敝無已。」以爲「諸欲立碑者，宜悉令言上，爲朝議所許，然後聽之。庶可以防遏無徵，顯彰茂實，使百世之下，知其不虛，則義信於仰止，道孚於來葉。」由是並斷。"}],"rationale":"碑銘撰文引古蔡邕，當前全label/alias無同名canonical；發來源局部身份，非憑百科定傳記。","human_reviewed":false,"reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-houhanshu-064-luzhi:p003","text":"嵗餘復徴拜議郎與諫議大夫馬日磾議郎蔡邕楊彪韓說等並在東觀校中書五經記傳補續漢記帝以非急務轉為侍中遷尚書","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-houhanshu-064-luzhi:p003:m0012","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"馬日磾","kind":"person","person_id":"66n_s45_86s","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事及引語主客辨識；原字與來源層保留。"},{"id":"c-houhanshu-064-luzhi:p003:m0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"蔡邕","kind":"person","person_id":"gs5_qqu_9ui","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事及引語主客辨識；原字與來源層保留。"},{"id":"c-houhanshu-064-luzhi:p003:m0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"楊彪","kind":"person","person_id":"0c1_b9d_9c2","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事及引語主客辨識；原字與來源層保留。"},{"id":"c-houhanshu-064-luzhi:p003:m0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"韓說","kind":"person","person_id":"59s_8f3_irg","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事及引語主客辨識；原字與來源層保留。"},{"id":"c-houhanshu-064-luzhi:p003:m0039","start":39,"end":40,"surface":"帝","kind":"person","person_id":"0wg_vtn_yqb","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事及引語主客辨識；原字與來源層保留。"}],"source_position":{"source_layer":"received_biography","first_line":290,"last_line":293,"raw_projection_ref":"source-evidence/houhan064-luzhi/projection.json","editorial_paragraph_boundary":true,"first_page_id":"KR2a0009_WYG_094-16b","last_page_id":"KR2a0009_WYG_094-16b"},"chapter_id":"c-houhanshu-064-luzhi","book_id":"b-houhanshu-064","work_id":"w-houhanshu","source_id":"s-houhanshu-064-luzhi"},{"id":"c-houhanshu-064-luzhi:p006","text":"帝崩大將軍何進謀誅中官乃召并州牧董卓以懼太后植知卓凶悍難制必生後患固止之進不從